  "audience_note": "<b>Soft week, mostly timing:</b> sessions, users, and page views were all down double digits YoY this week (sessions −20.9%, users −31.2%, page views −9.2%) against a strong comparable week a year ago. The one bright spot is the repeat-visit share, which jumped to <b>53.6%</b> from 46.0% a year ago as the returning audience held up better than new-visitor traffic (new visitors −27.4%). YTD the picture is steadier: repeat-visit share still edges out last year (49.5% vs 48.8%), while sessions, engagement rate, and session duration all remain softer YoY both this week and YTD.",
