  "subs_note": "<b>Print/digital split refreshed to the August by-term Subscription Report.</b> Of <b>46,738</b> active subs, <b>68.9% (32,216) are print</b> and <b>31.1% (14,522) digital</b> (~14,116 paid). <b>Encouraging shift:</b> new subscriptions rebounded to <b>691</b> in August (from 504 in July) and net adds climbed to <b>+122</b> (from +27) &mdash; the acquisition slump that had halved new subs YoY is easing. Print stays extremely sticky (~0.25%/mo churn); the dedicated <b>Sports Pass holds 693</b>. Year-over-year and YTD subscription trends aren't in the single-month by-term export &mdash; those will populate from the Piano API.",
